@title EPISODE 19 • CONFERENCE CHAMPIONSHIPS
@bg meet_venue_day
Conference Championships. Everything the season's been building to.
@show london
@if Coach_Respect 4 earned
Holloway: You're in the 5K. Your only job is to run your race. Not anyone else's.
@jump race
*earned
Holloway: (handing her a bib) 10K AND 5K. You earned both back. Don't make me sentimental, Sterling, I'll throw up.
*race
@show priya
Lap twenty. Priya's on your shoulder. Alana's a stride behind. The leader is from Eastbrook and she's fading.
> [Bold] Go now. All of it. Leave everyone. -> r1
> [Good] Pull Priya with you, like Coach asked. -> r2
> [Sweet] Look for Diggy in the stands. -> r3
*r1
@add London_Confidence 3
@add Gold_Medal 1
You don't remember the last two laps. You remember the tape against your chest and the noise, and Diggy over the fence screaming like he won something.
@jump r_done
*r2
@add Priya_Friendship 3
@add Coach_Respect 3
@add Team_Reputation 3
Second and third. Priya PRs by fourteen seconds and falls into your arms crying. Holloway turns away to "check her clipboard."
@jump r_done
*r3
@add Diggy_Affection 2
He's there. Of course he's there. He mouths "GO." You go. You finish fourth, and somehow it's still the best race of your life.
*r_done
@bg meet_venue_evening
@show diggy
Diggy runs a 46.9 in the 400. A school record. Everyone mobs him. He pushes through all of them to get to you.
@if First_Kiss 1 together
Diggy: Okay so I've been thinking. About the rain. About Thanksgiving. About everything.
London: Diggy—
Diggy: Go out with me. Real date. No studying, no relays, no Cassie.
> [Sweet] "Yes. Obviously yes." -> y1
> [Bitchy] "...Fine. But you're paying." -> y1
> [Good] "Ask me again after the season." -> y2
*y1
@add Dating 1
@add Diggy_Affection 3
@jump end
*y2
@add Diggy_Trust 2
Diggy: (grinning) Bet. I'm writing it in my phone.
@jump end
*together
Diggy kisses you in front of the entire conference, both teams, and three local news cameras.
@add Dating 1
@show cassie
Cassie: (already typing) I KNEW IT. I won the poll. I'm a prophet.
*end
@load s1/ep20.mvs
